tion is the most important part — it guides the next search iteration.\n- Be precise about which terms dominate and why conditions fail.\n- When showing that the candidate satisfy the sufficient condition, be extra careful, put your verification in solid math work that can pass all peer reviews.","numLines":89,"startLine":1,"totalLines":89}}}
